<div class="entry-content single-content">
	
<!--
SEO Title: Speed of Light: Exact Value, Formula & Why Nothing Goes Faster
Focus Keyword: speed of light
Meta Description: The speed of light is 299,792,458 m/s. Learn the exact value in every unit, the formula c = λf, why it's a universal speed limit, and how it's measured.
-->

